{"unit_id": "tag:06FH:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个包含于<MATH_0002>中的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0003>是一个群胚（groupoid），其对象为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。假设<MATH_0005>是平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的。那么态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>平坦（flat）、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）且满射（surjective）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "群胚的空间，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给映射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06FH:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是一个<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism）。我们须证明投影（projection）<MATH_0004>满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。我们已经知道左端是可表（representable）的，由代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0005>表示，见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》，引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>。因此须证明对应的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的满射（surjective）、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）且平坦（flat）的态射。由于我们所研究的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的性质在目标上是 fppf 拓扑（topology）局部的，可以在<MATH_0007>上 fppf 局部地检查。由构造，存在 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0008>，它覆盖<MATH_0009>，使<MATH_0010>来自态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>。（注意<MATH_0012>表示<MATH_0013>-纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0014>，所以一切都与沿<MATH_0015>进行的基变换（base change）相容。）因此可假设<MATH_0016>来自<MATH_0017>。此时可知<MATH_0018>。第一个等式（equality）由《范畴（Categories）》，引理<REF_0003>，第二个等式（equality）由《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》，引理<REF_0004>。显然，最后的<MATH_0019>-纤维积（fibre product）由代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0020>表示，而投影（projection）<MATH_0021>平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），因为它是平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（finitely presented）的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>的基变换（base change）。它也是满射（surjective）的，因为<MATH_0023>有一个截面（section）（即群胚（groupoid）的恒等（identity）<MATH_0024>）。这就证明了引理。\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "fppf covering", "target_term": "fppf 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限呈示"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "本处映射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "纤维积投影，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "可表性条件，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "表示对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠", "context": "引用章节名，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "态射所属空间，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "性质的载体，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "局部性所用拓扑，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "fppf covering", "target_term": "fppf 覆盖", "context": "所取覆盖，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "fibre product", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "二纤维积，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "所用操作，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式", "context": "显示等式，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "引用章节名，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "引用章节名，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限呈示", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "所用截面，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "恒等所属群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等", "context": "群胚恒等，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
