{"unit_id": "tag:06FI:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个包含于<MATH_0002>中的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0003>是一个群胚（groupoid），其对象为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。假设<MATH_0005>平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。那么商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>上的代数叠（algebraic stack）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quotient stack", "target_term": "商叠"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "所给群胚，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "群胚的空间，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "态射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "quotient stack", "target_term": "商叠", "context": "所构造对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠", "context": "结论中的对象，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06FI:proof", "translation": "我们对态射（morphism）检查定理<REF_0001>的两个条件，该态射为<MATH_0001>。第一个条件是平凡的（因为<MATH_0002>是代数空间（algebraic space））。第二个条件即引理<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定理应用的态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "第一条件中的对象，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06PI:title", "translation": "商叠（quotient stack）何时是代数的（algebraic）？", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quotient stack", "target_term": "商叠"}, {"source_term": "algebraic", "target_term": "代数的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quotient stack", "target_term": "商叠", "context": "标题中的对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic", "target_term": "代数的", "context": "标题中的性质，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:06PI:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》，第<REF_0001>节中，我们定义了商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0001>，它关联于群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0002>，后者由代数空间（algebraic spaces）组成。注意<MATH_0003>是群胚（groupoids）中的叠（stack），其对角（diagonal）是可表（representable）的，由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（见《自举》，引理<REF_0002>，以及《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》，引理<REF_0003>），且存在代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>及<MATH_0005>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，它是一个“fppf 满射（surjection）”，意指它在对象（objects）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的预层（presheaves）上诱导一个映射（map），该映射在层化（sheafification）后变为满射（surjective）。然而，一般而言，<MATH_0007>并不是代数叠（algebraic stack）。这与定理<REF_0004>并不矛盾，因为<MATH_0008>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>可能并不平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n构造非代数（non-algebraic）商叠（quotient stacks）例子的最容易方法，是考察形如<MATH_0010>的商（quotients），其中<MATH_0011>为概形（scheme），而<MATH_0012>为<MATH_0013>上的群概形（group scheme），它在<MATH_0014>上的作用（acting）是平凡的（trivially）。也就是说，我们将在下文（引理<REF_0005>）看到，如果<MATH_0015>是代数的（algebraic），那么<MATH_0016>必须平坦（flat）且局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）。一个具体例子见《例子》，第<REF_0006>节。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "quotient stack", "target_term": "商叠"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "stack", "target_term": "叠"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"sourc